{
  "//": [
    "BUNDLED FALLBACK INDEX -- NOT A COMPLIANCE-GRADE SANCTIONS LIST.",
    "",
    "This exists so a container that cannot reach GCS still screens against",
    "something rather than answering CLEAN to everything. It is deliberately",
    "small and its entity ids are synthetic.",
    "",
    "The real index is built by scripts/refresh_sanctions.py from OpenSanctions",
    "and written to the GCS object named by SANCTIONS_INDEX_BUCKET /",
    "SANCTIONS_INDEX_OBJECT. sanctions.load() prefers that and falls back here,",
    "recording in load_error() that it did so -- a fallback that looked like a",
    "successful load would be worse than a failure.",
    "",
    "Licensing: OpenSanctions bulk data is CC-BY-NC 4.0, which prohibits",
    "commercial use. Swap to OFAC SDN (US Government, public domain) before",
    "selling this. sanctions/sources/ is plugin-shaped so that is one new file,",
    "not a rewrite.",
    "",
    "Continuity: the first three entities mirror verifier.BLACKLIST_COMPANIES so",
    "the code-resident list and the screening index agree rather than disagreeing",
    "about the same company. The alias variants on each are the actual evasion",
    "technique -- a declarant does not need the name spelled correctly, only close",
    "enough to pass a customs officer and far enough to miss an exact-match filter."
  ],
